{
  "uid": "marin-topline",
  "title": "Top line (prototype)",
  "description": "Top-line GPU numbers per cluster, read live from Finelog: GPU-hours held, busy and tensor-active on the CoreWeave clusters, and MFU of Levanter training runs.",
  "tags": [
    "marin",
    "prototype"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "query": "cw-rno2a,cw-us-east-02a,cw-us-east-08a",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "GPU-hours held",
      "description": "CoreWeave GPUs the node agent sees (hardware_inventory rows x 60 s), in the time range. Reads about 1% low: collections are 60.7 s apart, not 60 s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
          },
          "panelId": 5
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "/^held_gpu_hours$/"
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "GPU-hours busy (SM-active)",
      "description": "Each 60 s GPU sample weighted by gpu_sm_active_ratio (the top-line busy figure).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
          },
          "panelId": 5
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "/^sm_active_gpu_hours$/"
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "GPU-hours tensor-active",
      "description": "Each 60 s GPU sample weighted by gpu_tensor_active_ratio: an efficiency figure beside busy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
          },
          "panelId": 5
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "/^tensor_active_gpu_hours$/"
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Per cluster",
      "description": "Held, busy and tensor-active GPU-hours per CoreWeave cluster in the time range, and busy as a share of held.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
          },
          "panelId": 5
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {
              "cluster": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "held_gpu_hours": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "sm_active_gpu_hours": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "tensor_active_gpu_hours": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "calculateField",
          "options": {
            "mode": "binary",
            "alias": "busy / held",
            "binary": {
              "left": "sm_active_gpu_hours (sum)",
              "operator": "/",
              "right": "held_gpu_hours (sum)"
            },
            "replaceFields": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "held_gpu_hours (sum)": "held GPU-h",
              "sm_active_gpu_hours (sum)": "busy (SM-active) GPU-h",
              "tensor_active_gpu_hours (sum)": "tensor-active GPU-h"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "busy / held"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Held and busy GPUs per hour",
      "description": "GPU-hours per hour bucket, per cluster: held (solid) and SM-active busy (dashed). This panel's query also feeds the stats and the per-cluster table.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "finelog-marin"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "format": "table",
          "parser": "backend",
          "url": "/query",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET",
            "params": [
              {
                "key": "sql",
                "value": "SELECT cluster, date_bin(INTERVAL '1 hour', to_timestamp_millis(timestamp_ms), TIMESTAMP '1970-01-01 00:00:00') AS hour, sum(CASE WHEN name = 'hardware_inventory' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 60 / 3600.0 AS held_gpu_hours, sum(CASE WHEN name = 'gpu_sm_active_ratio' THEN value ELSE 0 END) * 60 / 3600.0 AS sm_active_gpu_hours, sum(CASE WHEN name = 'gpu_tensor_active_ratio' THEN value ELSE 0 END) * 60 / 3600.0 AS tensor_active_gpu_hours FROM \"telemetry_v1.node_agent\" WHERE service = 'iris-node-agent' AND name IN ('hardware_inventory', 'gpu_sm_active_ratio', 'gpu_tensor_active_ratio') AND json_get(attributes_json, 'gpu_uuid') IS NOT NULL AND cluster IN (${cluster:sqlstring}) AND timestamp_ms >= CAST(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM {{from}}) * 1000 AS BIGINT) AND timestamp_ms < CAST(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM {{to}}) * 1000 AS BIGINT) GROUP BY cluster, hour ORDER BY cluster, hour"
              },
              {
                "key": "from",
                "value": "${__from}"
              },
              {
                "key": "to",
                "value": "${__to}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "cluster",
              "text": "cluster",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "hour",
              "text": "hour",
              "type": "timestamp_epoch"
            },
            {
              "selector": "held_gpu_hours",
              "text": "held_gpu_hours",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "sm_active_gpu_hours",
              "text": "sm_active_gpu_hours",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "tensor_active_gpu_hours",
              "text": "tensor_active_gpu_hours",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "partitionByValues",
          "options": {
            "fields": [
              "cluster"
            ],
            "keepFields": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/sm_active/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/tensor_active/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hideFrom",
                "value": {
                  "legend": true,
                  "tooltip": false,
                  "viz": true
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Levanter training runs: MFU",
      "description": "Runs that logged throughput_mfu to levanter.metrics in the time range: median MFU per run. Levanter training only (pretraining, SFT, DPO); RL and inference are not covered.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "finelog-marin"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "format": "table",
          "parser": "backend",
          "url": "/query",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET",
            "params": [
              {
                "key": "sql",
                "value": "SELECT COALESCE(NULLIF(cluster, ''), 'marin') AS cluster, job_id, run_id, median(value) AS median_mfu, count(DISTINCT step) AS steps, max(step) AS last_step FROM \"levanter.metrics\" WHERE name = 'throughput_mfu' AND timestamp_ms >= CAST(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM {{from}}) * 1000 AS BIGINT) AND timestamp_ms < CAST(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM {{to}}) * 1000 AS BIGINT) GROUP BY 1, job_id, run_id ORDER BY steps DESC LIMIT 200"
              },
              {
                "key": "from",
                "value": "${__from}"
              },
              {
                "key": "to",
                "value": "${__to}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "cluster",
              "text": "cluster",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "job_id",
              "text": "job_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "run_id",
              "text": "run_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "median_mfu",
              "text": "median_mfu",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "steps",
              "text": "steps",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "last_step",
              "text": "last_step",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "median_mfu"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "steps",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mean of per-run median MFU (unweighted)",
      "description": "Unweighted: every Levanter run in the table counts once, whatever its size or GPU-hours.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
          },
          "panelId": 6
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "mean"
          ],
          "fields": "/^median_mfu$/"
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Not on this dashboard yet",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "- **GPU-hours allocated** (and TPU chip-hours): needs a precomputed table. The live query must read weeks of `iris.controller_db__task_attempts` and `job_config` to catch long attempts, and even a 1-day lookback took 14 s on the hub.\n- **Weekly figures**: about one day of `node_agent` GPU rows per cluster is the most a query can scan in Finelog's 10 s.\n- **Use by category**: waits for the job tag column, which the controller does not write yet.\n- **TPUs held**: not timed yet.\n\nThis dashboard queries the prod `marin` hub live: keep the range short (default 15 min) and leave auto-refresh off."
      }
    }
  ]
}
